Subject: [PATCH 03/11] feat(15-02): add Prometheus compact chrome layout gate

- Add compact chrome sizing and reserved-control allocation helpers
- Gate BrowserView tabbed layout on prometheus.chrome.mode
- Preserve Chromium's conventional layout for separate/default mode
---
